> [J]omsom Muktinath Trek is an[ exciting] trek in[ the] Ann[ap]urn[a] and Mustang regions[ of] Nepal[. The] 13[-]day trek begins from[ Kathmand]u with[ the] tour of UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Next, we fly to Pokh[ara], the beautiful Lake City and begin trekking from there. We trek in the beautiful Ann[ap]urna region and gradually[ enter the] Mustang region[.]
